mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.5em\" columnspacing=\"0.278em\" displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We can represent this solution using a number line, as follows. </p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-44745-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-44745-a-1\"></div>\n\n\n</div></div>",
